WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.366
The bar above the preview adjusts only the selected page. First, the sideways scan.

00:00:05.466 --> 00:00:11.327
It came out upside down: one Rotate left 90° sets it right.

00:00:11.427 --> 00:00:22.251
Rotate right 90° turns the other way.

00:00:22.351 --> 00:00:34.639
Now the crooked double sheet: -45° and +45° set a diagonal skew of 45° (for pages photographed at an angle)…

00:00:34.739 --> 00:00:38.606
…and Manual skew lets you set the exact angle yourself instead of the automatic one.

00:00:38.706 --> 00:00:42.066
Split this sheet: decide for this sheet alone how it is cut.

00:00:42.166 --> 00:00:45.165
Automatic, at the middle, or not at all.

00:00:45.265 --> 00:00:49.715
Output of this page: give one page another colour mode than the rest.

00:00:49.815 --> 00:01:02.905
Content box (mm): move each side of the crop outwards (+) or inwards (−).

00:01:03.005 --> 00:01:14.806
Undo and Redo step through your changes on this page; Reset brings the page back to the automatic result.
